<% content_for :title, "About — Wordcraze" %>

<div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto py-12 px-4">
  <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">About the Word Craze Game</h2>
  <p class="text-gray-600 mb-6">
    Wordcraze is an association game. The game grows richer the more people play —
    every word association you submit teaches the game something new.
  </p>

  <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">What can I do?</h3>
  <p class="text-gray-600 mb-4">
    You can associate words with other words, search for any word to see its associations,
    or click on the nodes in the graph and follow an interesting associative path, visually!
  </p>

  <p class="text-gray-600">
    Questions or comments?
    <%= link_to "Send us feedback.", give_feedback_path,
        class: "text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800 underline" %>
  </p>
</div>
